    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Halnon Humphreys Estate Agents are thrilled to present to the market this charming and well located 3 bedroom, semi-detached home situated in within minutes’ walk of Gorey Town Centre.  \r\nThis wonderful home is located within the heart of Gorey is within walking distance of the wide range of amenities Gorey has to offer such as numerous primary and secondary schools, shops, supermarkets, pubs and restaurants, sports and leisure facilities, Amber Springs and Ashdown Park Hotels, Gorey Train Station, public bus and so much more. \r\nThe M11 motorway is less than a 5-minute drive away being just 4.5km from the property and sandy beaches such as Ballymoney and Courtown are located within a 10 minute drive of this charming single storey property. \r\nNo. 5 Clonattin Road was built in c. 1940 and is presented in excellent condition having been refurbished in recent years. Accommodation measures c. 95 sq. m/1022 sq. ft. \r\nOutside:\r\nThe property is approached via timber gates with a stone driveway offering parking to the front for two cars. A large and enclosed southwest facing garden is situated to the rear offering sunshine from noon until sunset. There is gated access to the rear for additional parking if required. The property benefits from a large steel shed offering generous storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation is light filled with a bright hallway greeting you upon entering the property. There is a living room located to the front of the residence offering timber flooring a cozy inset solid fuel stove for winter months, three double bedrooms, a large bathroom and a kitchen and dining area. French doors lead to the large and enclosed south west facing rear garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "C1 Energy Rating\r\nOil fired heating\r\nHigh speed broadband is available in the area\r\nApprox. 95 sq. m/1022 sq. ft\r\nBuilt c. 1940\r\nRefurbished in recent years\r\nLarge southwest facing enclosed rear garden\r\nDriveway parking \r\nMains water and sewerage\r\nShort stroll to Gorey Town Centre, amenities and public transport links\r\nLess than a 5-minute drive to the M11 Motorway\r\n10 minute drive to sandy beaches"
      },
      {
